{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261017/photo/bkn-20261017200552264-1017_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261017215114\"/><p>今晚(17日)攪珠的今年第111期六合彩，攪珠結果為3、13、27、29、30、40，特別號碼9。頭獎無人中；二獎1.5注中，每注派彩1,123,160港元；三獎76.4注中，每注派58,800港元。</p><p>下期六合彩將於周二(20日)晚上9時30分攪珠，估計頭獎基金達19,000,000港元。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T13:58:53.946525+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":153,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T12:05:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T13:57:38.376164+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T13:57:38.376164+00:00","content_hash":"a41d27f934e913608fb456a0ccbfbf5745d251ccd3ecb1dd357b5e40ee24c95e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}